# autotest alpha.10 batch G (lane SC2, 2026-11-24). Written against the Feature text with sha c960a3e2e565e4ff; honest subset only: what a screen or the guest shows is under clause, everything else under not-covered.
row: F-LOOK-01
targets: qemu
profile: ram
feature-sha: c960a3e2e565e4ff
doc: Settings, Appearance offers the parts of the Look (read only)
clause: 1 Settings, Appearance offers the parts a Look is made of: wallpaper, icon style, shape and size, names and the launcher layout
not-covered: the home widgets and motion
not-covered: the default Look being equal to today's behaviour
not-covered: a Look file round trip
key s
wait app=Settings
skip-unless-button Appearance
click-sidebar Appearance
wait app=Settings page="Appearance"
shot page
expect-not-blank
expect-text Wallpaper
expect-page Appearance
